OL,3,GNEWSAThe three-year fight over two
OL,4,Aparking fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who spent three years fighting
OL,7,Fparking fines issued at a care home she
OL,8,Fsays she was authorised to use is
OL,9,Fcalling for changes to the way private
OL,10,Fparking firms operate.
OL,12,FVal Price, 70, received two parking
OL,13,Fcharge notices despite being on the
OL,14,Fsite's whitelist of approved vehicles
OL,15,Fand visiting the care home more than
OL,16,F100 times.
OL,18,FTwo weeks before the dispute was due to
OL,19,Fbe heard in court, Smart Parking Ltd
OL,20,Fdropped its claim.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
